  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6107.01 Right to a Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6107.01 Right to a Hearing. Anyone aggrieved by a decision of the commissioner pursuant to these rules and RSA 270-D:10 et. seq. shall be entitled to a hearing.\n\nSource. #7650, eff 2-20-02; ss by #9472, eff 5-18-09; ss by #12467, eff 1-25-18",
